From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: V <61495413+kelo221@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Mon, 12 Oct 2026 11:59:06 +0300
Subject: [PATCH] WavStreamInstance::hasEnded: a looping stream has not ended

Matches WavInstance::hasEnded. Without the guard, consumers that ask the
instance directly (for example Queue) saw a looping stream as finished.

From upstream PR #379 (pgrAm).
---
 src/audiosource/wav/soloud_wavstream.cpp | 2 +-
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+), 1 deletion(-)

diff --git a/src/audiosource/wav/soloud_wavstream.cpp b/src/audiosource/wav/soloud_wavstream.cpp
index 090e8da..96731b6 100644
--- a/src/audiosource/wav/soloud_wavstream.cpp
+++ b/src/audiosource/wav/soloud_wavstream.cpp
@@ -397,7 +397,7 @@ namespace SoLoud
 
 	bool WavStreamInstance::hasEnded()
 	{
-		if (mOffset >= mParent->mSampleCount)
+		if (!(mFlags & AudioSourceInstance::LOOPING) && mOffset >= mParent->mSampleCount)
 		{
 			return 1;
 		}
